* COMMANDOS - BEHIND ENEMY LINES *
Welcome to another great CLASS release.. This time we bring you the FINAL and working version of this kickass game from Eidos.. The beta version released a month ago by BLH was buggy and not even close to beeing a final.. So if you are the kind of guy that dont like playing a cool game and see it freeze in the middle of the game, you got the right version now..  Regards to all the quality minded people out there...   The summer is here!  make sure you get out and enjoy it...     Animal And Dogfriend - CLASS 98...       Hit the spacebar to rock..           ¤


























 
